{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18489","headline":"汝川行 · 欧阳詹","name":"汝川行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汝坟春女蚕忙月，朝起采桑日西没。\n轻绡裙露红罗袜，半蹋金梯倚枝歇。\n垂空玉腕若无骨，映叶朱唇似花发。\n相欢谁是游冶郎，蚕休不得岐路旁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}